From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aegis Packaging Proposal <aegis-proposal@invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: expose macOS site allow/block/off intent API

Add product-facing AccessSiteIntent helpers and keep Chromium patch
series synchronized with the overlay. Block stays outside ordinary
DIRECT publication.

---
